<title>SINGAPORE: Liang Court acquires new subsidiary.</title>
<headline>Liang Court acquires new subsidiary.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Liang Court Holdings Ltd said on Friday it had acquired a Singapore subsidiary, Vaudeville Investments (S) Pte Ltd.</p>
<p>Vaudeville has an authorised capital of Singapore $100,000 and a paid-up capital of S$2, Liang Court said in a statement.</p>
<p>The subsidiary, which will serve as an investment holding company, is dormant for the time being.</p>
